Coefficient of $x^{17}$ in $\left(3 x-\frac{x^3}{6}\right)^9\begin{aligned}
& =9 C_4(3 x)^{9-4} \times\left(-\frac{x^3}{6}\right)^4 \\
& =9 C_4 \times 3^5 \times\left(-\frac{1}{6}\right)^4 \\
& =\frac{19}{4 \mid 5} \times \frac{3^5}{6^4}=\frac{189}{8}
\end{aligned}$

